; The "Maps N" sections hold the map headers, scripts, text pointer tables, objects and
; block data. Save files contain pointers to those for the map the game was saved on
; (the game does not look them up again on CONTINUE), so each of these sections is
; pinned where the cartridge has it. A section that grows into the next pinned one is a
; link error: move the new code to another bank instead.
